# Lab GCS (Cloud Agent / Cursor Web)

Large artifacts live in this repo's private `*-lab` bucket, not the working tree. On Cursor Web / Cloud Agent VMs, `lab_gcs.py` mints OIDC from `CURSOR_AGENT_SOCKET` and federates to `cursor-lab-reader` (lab buckets only). Do not ask for JSON keys. Do not use production buckets.

To mint OIDC tokens, follow https://cursor.com/docs/cloud-agent/identity

```bash
python3 lab_gcs.py probe
python3 -c "from lab_gcs import open_text; print(open_text('.cursor-wif-probe.txt').read())"
```

If `google-cloud-storage` is missing: `python3 -m pip install --user 'google-cloud-storage>=2.14'`. Stream JSON; fetch weights to `/tmp/lab-gcs`, not the repo.
